Package: toxtools
Title: Utilities for Ecotoxicological Data Handling and Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rebecca", "Fisher", , "r.fisher@aims.gov.au", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Australian Institute of Marine Science", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: A collection of utility functions supporting ecotoxicological
    workflows, including data preparation, summarisation and helpers shared
    across concentration-response and species sensitivity distribution
    analyses.
